WEBVTT

1
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Nathan B.: Morning, everyone. Launch status first, then onboarding, then reminders.

2
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Daniel K.: Sure. I'd like five minutes on onboarding too.

3
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:19.000
Nathan B.: Self-serve first. The pricing page draft is ready, but checkout still needs billing support for monthly plans.

4
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:26.000
Nathan B.: The target is to launch before the Q4 campaign starts on 2 November.

5
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Emma C.: Is checkout the only thing between us and launch?

6
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Nathan B.: Checkout and billing. The rest is copy.

7
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.000
Nathan B.: Emma, onboarding.

8
00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:55.000
Emma C.: Right. The numbers are not good.

9
00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:21.000
Emma C.: 41% of new signups never create their first booking. I'll break the funnel down by step so we stop guessing.

10
00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:30.000
Emma C.: My bet is the calendar-connect step, but that stays a bet until we have the numbers.

11
00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:44.000
Daniel K.: The calendar step is the longest screen we have.

12
00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:08.000
Nathan B.: Forty-one percent is higher than I expected.

13
00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:27.000
Emma C.: And it isn't the ads. Paid signups stall at the same rate.

14
00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:47.000
Daniel K.: So nearly half stall before the first booking. That's onboarding, not acquisition.

15
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.000
Nathan B.: Agreed. Onboarding is this quarter's problem.

16
00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:09.000
Emma C.: I'll have the step numbers by Friday.

17
00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:15.000
Nathan B.: Billing next. Anna, can Chidi size the billing work for monthly plans?

18
00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:29.000
Anna H.: He knows that code best, but he's out today.

19
00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:48.000
Anna H.: Monthly billing is the unknown, so give me until Wednesday for a real estimate on monthly billing.

20
00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:54.000
Nathan B.: Wednesday works.

21
00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:06.000
Anna H.: Chidi will pair with me on it.

22
00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:49.000
Emma C.: If billing slips, does the launch slip with it?

23
00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:06.000
Nathan B.: That's what I want to settle now.

24
00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:28.000
Nathan B.: Then the launch stays on track for the week of 26 October, and the billing estimate decides whether it slips.

25
00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:38.000
Daniel K.: Week of the 26th, got it.

26
00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:53.000
Anna H.: I'll know more on Wednesday.

27
00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.000
Nathan B.: One more thing: scope.

28
00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:35.000
Emma C.: Please. People keep adding to it.

29
00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:51.000
Anna H.: Deal. No new scope on the self-serve tier until the estimate is in.

30
00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.000
Nathan B.: Agreed.

31
00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:05.000
Emma C.: Does that include annual plans?

32
00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:14.000
Nathan B.: Let's take that as its own question.

33
00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:08.000
Nathan B.: Back to annual plans, Emma.

34
00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:19.000
Emma C.: Clinics on the waitlist keep asking about it.

35
00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:36.000
Emma C.: Do annual plans need to be in the self-serve tier at launch?

36
00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:41.000
Nathan B.: I can't say before the billing estimate is in.

37
00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:50.000
Emma C.: Fair. Let's come back to it once Anna has the number.

38
00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.000
Anna H.: Wednesday, as promised.

39
00:26:50.000 --> 00:26:52.000
Nathan B.: Anna, reminders?

40
00:27:08.000 --> 00:27:10.000
Anna H.: Good news for once.

41
00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:38.000
Anna H.: Reminders: we switched the SMS provider last week, and failures dropped from 3.1% to 0.8%.

42
00:27:45.000 --> 00:27:48.000
Daniel K.: Is that across all clinics?

43
00:27:52.000 --> 00:27:54.000
Anna H.: Yes, all of them.

44
00:28:40.000 --> 00:28:44.000
Nathan B.: Do we keep an eye on it?

45
00:28:52.000 --> 00:28:56.000
Daniel K.: Clinics notice a missed reminder before we do.

46
00:29:05.000 --> 00:29:10.000
Anna H.: I'll keep watching SMS failures for two more weeks.

47
00:29:15.000 --> 00:29:18.000
Nathan B.: Good. That's everything for today.

48
00:29:22.000 --> 00:29:24.000
Emma C.: Thanks, all.
